<span class="tok-1itgoe">  from</span><span class="tok-140thh"> sd_blog_article</span>
<span class="tok-1itgoe"> where</span><span class="tok-1itgoe"> status</span><span class="tok-1itgoe"> =</span><span class="tok-mdbnqw"> ''1''</span>
<span class="tok-1itgoe"> order by</span><span class="tok-140thh"> published_at </span><span class="tok-1itgoe">desc</span>
<span class="tok-1itgoe"> limit</span><span class="tok-dzsirb"> 20</span><span class="tok-140thh">;</span></code></pre><p>执行计划里出现 filesort 就说明排序没有走索引；补一个联合索引后再看，type 从 ALL 变成 range，排序消失。</p><blockquote><p>先用五分钟证伪，胜过用五小时论证。</p></blockquote><p>这套"最小实验"的习惯，最大的收益不是省时间，而是让讨论从"我觉得"变成"跑出来是这样"。</p>', 1761000000000000103, 2210000000000000003, '2026-09-30 12:34:00', 2210000000000000003, '2026-09-30 12:34:00', '0');
